        <section id="what-are-wegovy-tablets">
          <h2>What Are Wegovy Tablets?</h2>
          <div class="tab-content-sec">
            <p>Wegovy tablets contain semaglutide, a medicine that works by mimicking GLP-1 — a hormone your body naturally produces after eating. GLP-1 signals to your brain that you're full, slows how quickly food leaves your stomach, and reduces the urge to keep eating.</p>
            <p>For people living with obesity or excess weight, this system often doesn't function as it should. Semaglutide restores those fullness signals, making it easier to eat less, feel satisfied with smaller meals, and cut through persistent food cravings.</p>
            <p>What makes the tablet possible is a delivery ingredient called SNAC. It protects semaglutide from being broken down in the stomach, allowing it to be absorbed directly through the stomach lining. This is what makes a once-daily oral GLP-1 treatment viable at a dose proven to support meaningful weight loss.</p>
            <p class="read-more-link content-description"><a href="https://www.pharmacyplanet.com/what-are-wegovy-tablets " style="color: #2C596D;
    font-weight: 600;">Read More</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="how-effective-are-wegovy-tablets">
          <h2>How Effective Are Wegovy Tablets?</h2>
          <div class="tab-content-sec">
            <p>The OASIS 4 clinical trial — published in the New England Journal of Medicine in 2025 — followed adults with overweight or obesity for 71 weeks. All participants received lifestyle support alongside treatment.</p>
            <p>Someone starting at 16 stone would lose around 2 stone 2 pounds on average. More than half of participants also reported that everyday physical activities felt easier by the end of the trial.</p>
            <p>Beyond weight, the trial recorded improvements in waist size, blood fats, blood pressure, and blood sugar levels. Over 7 in 10 people who had prediabetes at the start of the study had normal blood sugar readings by week 64.</p>
            <p><em>Source: Wharton S, et al. N Engl J Med 2025;393:1077–1087 (OASIS 4). Le Roux CW, et al. OASIS 4 secondary analysis. ECO 2026.</em></p>
            <p class="read-more-link content-description"><a href="https://www.pharmacyplanet.com/how-much-weight-do-you-lose-on-wegovy-tablets " style="color: #2C596D;
    font-weight: 600;">Read More</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="do-you-have-exercise-wegovy-tablets">
          <h2>Do You Have To Exercise While Taking Wegovy Tablets?</h2>
          <div class="tab-content-sec">
            <p>You do not need to exercise for Wegovy tablets to work, as appetite reduction can support weight loss on its own. However, staying active can improve the quality of your results by helping your body maintain muscle as you lose fat.</p>
            <p>You do not need intense workouts. Regular strength training and enough protein can help protect muscle, support a stronger body, and help you maintain your results in the long term.</p>
            <p class="read-more-link content-description"><a href="https://www.pharmacyplanet.com/losing-weight-vs-looking-your-best-why-exercise-matters" style="color: #2C596D;
    font-weight: 600;">Read More</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>


        <section id="does-diet-quality-matter-wegovy-tablets">
          <h2>Does Diet Quality Matter While Taking Wegovy Tablets?</h2>
          <div class="tab-content-sec">
            <p>Wegovy tablets can reduce your appetite, so you may find yourself eating less than usual. But when your portions are smaller, it is still important to get enough protein, vitamins and minerals to support your muscles, bones, skin and hair as you lose weight.</p>
            <p>You do not need to follow a strict diet. Just focus on simple, nutritious meals rather than filling up on foods that offer little nutritional value. If you are unsure what to eat, our clinical team can offer practical, personalised advice.</p>
            <p class="read-more-link content-description"><a href="https://www.pharmacyplanet.com/eating-less-vs-eating-well-why-nutrition-matters" style="color: #2C596D;
    font-weight: 600;">Read More</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>


        <section id="wegovy-tablets-vs-injection">
          <h2>Wegovy Tablets vs Wegovy Injections</h2>
          <div class="tab-content-sec">
            <p>Both contain semaglutide and work through the same mechanism. The difference is how they're delivered — and for many patients, that's the whole point.</p>
            <p>The injection produces slightly higher average weight loss overall, but Wegovy tablets show a higher proportion of patients losing 20% or more. For anyone who prefers not to inject, the tablet is a clinically meaningful option — not a lesser one.</p>
            <p><em>Tablet data: OASIS 4 (Wharton et al, NEJM 2025). Injection data: STEP 1 (Wilding et al, NEJM 2021). Cross-trial comparisons should be interpreted with caution.</em></p>
          </div>
        </section>

